      "id": "El Paso County Ballot Issue 1A",
      "title": "Extension of the existing 0.23% public safety sales and use tax",
      "summary": "Extends El Paso County's existing 0.23% public safety sales and use tax to January 1, 2037, without raising the rate. The revenue may be used only for law enforcement, criminal justice and county jail needs, and wildland fire and emergency response, and the Sheriff's Office must report revenue and spending each year at a public Board of County Commissioners hearing.",
